## Rules
- Never read or print `.env`, keys or credentials (a hook blocks it). Ask the user to set secrets.
- Never run destructive commands (a hook blocks the common ones). Never force-push.
- Ask before adding a dependency.
- Use mock or sample data from `{{fixtures/}}`; never connect to production.

